== eval-alpha-only-size: alpha-head-only policies (job / machine heads fixed to MDD-PTECT) on B2 and the size grid (law alpha 3); seeds 0-39
   window tardiness, % vs MDD-PTECT pooled over instances [95% CI] better/worse Wilcoxon p

